@bank all
// SW1 (2026-10-25, patch 0.92.6 items 18, 14 and 11, for FX19's worksText): the first promotion made obvious. The
// Tier 1 steps are New, Steady, Reliable, Trusted, Relied on; the Tier 2 test needs Reliable (Relied on until 2026-10-25) and Making it safe, from
// Day 8. Calder speaks unless noted: exact, numbers not adjectives, never "well done" (her arc's payoff) and no "!".
// Mails are "Subject | body", unsigned (the game adds the sender). Each beat fires once.

// toasts, said by nobody, when your reputation word changes at Tier 1 ({band})
// FX19, interim for SW2 to re-voice (the user's design change, 05:25 UTC: the test the day after Reliable; Making it
// safe and Day 9 still needed). Retired with it, kept here: works.rep.up.trusted, promo.trusted, promo.missing.m6,
// promo.missing.day (their keys not reused).
== works.rep.up.steady
- Now Steady. One more step, Reliable, and you're up for your Tier 2 test.
== works.rep.up.reliable
- Now Reliable. That's the reputation your Tier 2 test needs.
// retired 2026-10-25: == works.rep.up.trusted
// - Now Trusted. One more step, Relied on, and you're up for your Tier 2 test.

// Calder, at Reliable without Making it safe yet, if she's near (a bubble); else the Mail
== promo.sight
- Reliable. Good. One thing left: Making it safe, with me. Then your Tier 2 test.
== promo.sight.mail
- Your next step | Reliable. One thing left before your Tier 2 test: Making it safe, with me, from Day 8.

// retired 2026-10-25: == promo.trusted
// - Trusted. One more step. Then we talk about your test.

// the big beat: Reliable + Making it safe + Day 8 or later (her bubble; promo.announce follows it)
== promo.ready
- Reliable, and Making it safe done. That's all of it. Your Tier 2 test.
// the Mail, always ({day}: a weekday or "tomorrow")
== promo.ready.mail
- Your Tier 2 test | Ready. Test job {day}, 09:00, Works bay. Pass it and you're an Officer.
// the device's urgent notice ({day})
== promo.ready.notice
- Your Tier 2 test: {day}, 09:00, the Works bay.

// Mail once: Relied on, but Making it safe not done
// retired 2026-10-25: == promo.missing.m6
// - Almost | Relied on. One thing left before your Tier 2 test: Making it safe, with me.
// Mail once: qualified before Day 8
// retired 2026-10-25: == promo.missing.day
// - Soon | You're ready early. I set Tier 2 tests from the second Monday. We'll talk then.

// the Record's "What's next" while you're below Reliable, with FX19's switch on ({band} now;
// next.t2.rep in next.lines stays the switch-off line: it's given {band} only)
== next.t2.steps
- Your Tier 2 test needs Reliable and Making it safe. You're {band}.

// the Works app's Training tab, "Your promotion" checklist
== works.promo.check.title
- Your promotion: the Tier 2 test
== works.promo.check.day
- The test from Day 9
== works.promo.check.rep
- Reliable (you're {band})
== works.promo.check.m6
- Making it safe, with the Chief
== works.promo.check.set
- Test job: {day}, 09:00
== works.promo.check.done
- Done
== works.promo.check.not
- Not yet

// Calder's Mail, the first time your ship-wide work reputation turns dependable
== promo.dependable
- Dependable | Word is you're dependable. Get to Reliable at work, and we talk about your Tier 2 test.

// optional (item 11): the chip on board jobs of a kind you're trained in
== works.board.trade
- Your trade
